    "level": "2",
    "key": "diamond:taken",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-diamond-taken-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Right. The service door. Keep moving.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "diamond:taken",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-hint-shutter-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Stand at the override. R to record, hold E a few seconds, R again. Then walk while my Echo holds it.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "hint:shutter",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-hint-sensors-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Stairs in the north-east corner. Up top, record myself on one plate, rewind, take the other.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "hint:sensors",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-hint-hatch-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Both plates are locked. Hold the override by the hatch.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "hint:hatch",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-hint-zipline-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "The line is at the far edge of the roof. Clip on.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "hint:zipline",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-level-start-2",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Two-person interlock. My rig can replay the second operator’s signal. I can still reach my roof line.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "level:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-player-detected-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Seen. Move!",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "player:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-player-detected-2",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Not now. Not now.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "player:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-alarm-alert-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Keep breathing. Find the quiet route.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "alarm:alert",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-echo-start-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Recording. Show me how it's done.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "echo:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-echo-replay-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "There I am. Still better company than Dex.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "echo:replay",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-echo-shattered-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "They broke my Echo. Again, then.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "echo:shattered",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-evidence-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "\"Leave the safecracker inside.\" Got you, Dex.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "evidence",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-level-complete-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "One stone, one safecracker, no handler. Time to go.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "level:complete",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-evidence-uploaded-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Three files. Names, orders, payment. Sending it all. Your turn to wait for the police, Dex.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "evidence:uploaded",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hint-rig-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "East wall, past the shipwreck painting. Staff door. Wait for the officer to leave the passage, then get to the desk.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hint:rig",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hint-badge-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Okafor stops on the west wall. Loop camera two, wait for his stop, come up behind him and hold E.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hint:badge",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hint-reader-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "The reader is at the end of the vault corridor. Through the gap in the rope at the back of the hall.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hint:reader",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hint-lobby-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "You are done here. Back to the lobby doors you came in through.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hint:lobby",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hint-circuit-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Through the lasers, then the panel on the west wall of the vault room. Hold E on it.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hint:circuit",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hint-safe-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Turn the dial slowly and press E when the signal peaks. Watch the timer for Briggs.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hint:safe",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hint-star-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "The safe is open. Walk up and take the Star.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hint:star",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hint-service-exit-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "The fire door is in the narrow corridor between the lasers and the vault. Go.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hint:service-exit",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-door-security-desk-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Camera tap linked. Your lens still reads sound; now Tab gives you their camera feeds too. Find Okafor.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "door:security-desk",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-any-door-security-desk-2",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "And I choose the way out this time. There is a line waiting on the roof.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "door:security-desk",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-camera-loop-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "That feed's on a loop for eight seconds. Security is watching a very boring rerun.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "camera:loop",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-camera-detected-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Camera's got you. Loop it or get out of its view.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "camera:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-camera-detected-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "You're on camera, Wren. Smile, then move.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "camera:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-player-detected-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "He's seen you. Break line of sight!",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "player:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-player-detected-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Spotted! Get behind something solid.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "player:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-player-caught-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Wren? Wren. Okay. Back to the checkpoint. Deep breath.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "player:caught",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-checkpoint-restore-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Again. Slower this time.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "checkpoint:restore",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-alarm-suspicious-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Easy. Somebody's twitchy. Find a quiet corner and let it settle.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "alarm:suspicious",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-alarm-alert-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "They're actively looking for you now. Get out of sight.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "alarm:alert",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-alarm-lockdown-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "That's lockdown. Well. That's the noisy version of the plan.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "alarm:lockdown",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-pickpocket-complete-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Smooth. Two years and you've still got the hands.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "pickpocket:complete",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-any-evidence-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Why is Dex's name on this?",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "evidence",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hazard-trip-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "That beam was not a suggestion.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hazard:trip",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-hazard-trip-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Under, over or wait. Pick one.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "hazard:trip",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-safe-noise-1",
